+## Configuration
+
+Set these environment variables to tune `retry.sh`:
+
+| Variable         | Default | Description                      |
+|------------------|---------|----------------------------------|
+| `RETRY_ATTEMPTS` | `5`     | Maximum number of attempts       |
+| `RETRY_DELAY`    | `2`     | Seconds to wait between attempts |
+
+    RETRY_ATTEMPTS=10 RETRY_DELAY=5 ./retry.sh curl -fsS http://localhost:8080/health
+
+## Exit status
+
+| Case                     | Exit status                         |
+|--------------------------|-------------------------------------|
+| An attempt succeeds      | `0`                                 |
+| Every attempt fails      | The exit status of the last attempt |
+| Called without a command | `2`                                 |
+
